{
  "inputs": [
    {
      "id": "366",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "My book?!? So you were the thief who stole it!\n\nBut...what is this new enchantment upon it...Bethor? He is in Lordaeron?\n\nIf he still exists, then perhaps he too escaped from the Lich King's grasp...",
      "englishSHA256": "160f2654a2543aafe0dd3b9aae20ef0b7a42ea983666ef170fa47de34bd8fd33"
    },
    {
      "id": "367",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "A New Plague",
      "englishSHA256": "b86e93de43e455ef0f3cb6fc30c078d691cadba4bd46b1845c55b93f401ba031"
    },
    {
      "id": "367",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Apothecary Johaan in the town of Brill wants you to collect 5 Vials of Darkhound Blood.",
      "englishSHA256": "6484468f7c32b979ac6a1f5e3ec6be5d6006df947889c7bb6c72ccf626a10d8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "367",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "Lady Sylvanas has called upon the Royal Apothecary Society. The Dark Lady believes our knowledge coupled with the newfound magic will provide the key to Arthas's demise.  She has challenged us to concoct a new plague, a plague deadlier than any ailment on Azeroth. This new disease will bring Arthas's Scourge Army to ruin.\n\nMy studies show that the blood of beasts might prove to be the key. Bring to me 5 vials of darkhound blood so I can test my theory.",
      "englishSHA256": "753d3321fa990ec83eb770390301c9ad1dfbd0fc7a772145f4eb96018c1ac965"
    },
    {
      "id": "367",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Have you collected 5 vials of darkhound blood yet, <name>? Time is fleeting!",
      "englishSHA256": "3ec601ed510d919cf3b55ea34c3efbaff34e0a2d514ea38e7566d49214ba9381"
    },
    {
      "id": "367",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "You have done well, <name> and I thank you for your efforts.",
      "englishSHA256": "cc950a7c9e94856bc242e28dd7bae91a6c3e24ca7d68072f49a7120a08be50b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "368",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "A New Plague",
      "englishSHA256": "b86e93de43e455ef0f3cb6fc30c078d691cadba4bd46b1845c55b93f401ba031"
    },
    {
      "id": "368",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Apothecary Johaan of the town of Brill needs 5 Vile Fin Scales from Murlocs in Tirisfal Glades.",
      "englishSHA256": "04899230cd3f218ed2ae071209b7bc99e5916d6d0171dd80c5afe8e81531983a"
    },
    {
      "id": "368",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "While you were collecting samples for me, my experiments led me to realize that more reagents will be required for this new disease to spread properly. Poisoning some hapless victim is child's play. Plaguing an entire world proves to be a bit more complicated.\n\nI will need 5 Vile Fin Scales from Murlocs in the vicinity.  You will find the creatures along the coast to the north or to the west.",
      "englishSHA256": "e1712d6d2785d9462b9385402368d763716783e63ede767e2ad8bd7c82756b19"
    },
    {
      "id": "368",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "<name>, were you able to obtain 5 Vile Fin Scales from the Murlocs?",
      "englishSHA256": "cf92a58ed09aabbbb015bff0b5a134cab5cc6361ae4f5487441552ff4818316a"
    },
    {
      "id": "368",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "The scales are perfect, <name>. Exactly what I needed for this concoction.",
      "englishSHA256": "0b2a9e4da686d7240deeba3f4349ed33a823024b5d4590e93fb8f92f8efc8000"
    },
    {
      "id": "369",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "A New Plague",
      "englishSHA256": "b86e93de43e455ef0f3cb6fc30c078d691cadba4bd46b1845c55b93f401ba031"
    },
    {
      "id": "369",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Apothecary Johaan in the town of Brill wants you to bring him 4 samples of venom from a Vicious Night Web Spider.",
      "englishSHA256": "889a2d450497776ab7e1b7df0d87a9f5160e53c66f592adfdfe2918b114636cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "369",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "While you were out gathering, I uncovered some old text in one of my tomes that indicates that an ancient plague wiped out thousands of innocent victims.  Later it was discovered that the deadly agent in the plague was preserved through the venom of Night Web Spiders.\n\nBring me some venom from a Vicious Night Web Spider to complete this experiment.  I want to see if the contagious element from the venom will work with my new concoction.  Rumor has it the spiders can be found in Eastern Tirisfal Glades.",
      "englishSHA256": "66dc3e9b82e18f99c6f53ecdc5f9e42a79611769dd943a6af114f57212be0fc5"
    },
    {
      "id": "369",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Do you have some venom from a Vicious Night Web Spider yet, <name>? It's the final component I need in order to test my experiment.",
      "englishSHA256": "e03acfc43f341989175d366c7f3df900ef6d8fb368dfe97d3bb45adc350e1e72"
    },
    {
      "id": "369",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Ah, this venom will do perfectly, <name>. Everything else has been added to my concoction and boiled down. Finally, I am ready to try this new deadly agent!",
      "englishSHA256": "10e46cfde03d55093beef712380ac253ee0c3a5c0445c96acbf70bd68bfbda54"
    },
    {
      "id": "370",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "At War With The Scarlet Crusade",
      "englishSHA256": "fbbd220b7b96d3d137b1510afcd7c5b31c44a1baa53fce9373abac935864c16b"
    },
    {
      "id": "370",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Executor Zygand in Brill wants you to kill Captain Perrine, 3 Scarlet Zealots and 3 Scarlet Missionaries.",
      "englishSHA256": "61dbe998338014460b2a9026099a18346f9c782c849cbdb0a8d9a98ce87a4394"
    },
    {
      "id": "370",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "The strategic documents from Executor Arren contain all the details we need to wipe the human infestation from the lands.  According to the information, The Scarlet Crusade has assigned Captain Perrine and a brigade to the ruined tower southwest of Brill.\n\nKill Perrine along with 3 Zealots and 3 Missionaries and report back to me.",
      "englishSHA256": "c3c620ae11f373bfb7da2040091489be077e2e25a619820fb6cf9bc5d9ec9a1a"
    },
    {
      "id": "370",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Young <class>, you shouldn't be wasting your time here in Brill when your people need you fighting for their cause. Now, take up arms and travel to the southwest, to the ruined tower, and slay Captain Perrine along with 3 Scarlet Zealots and 3 Scarlet Missionaries. We shall herd the Scarlet Crusade like cattle to their demise.",
      "englishSHA256": "5c6e9baf1c3b9c63a060af3ef986eb0c99144e7adc9e7df229be43804cc90d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "370",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Captain Perrine's death will undoubtedly please The Dark Lady. You have performed your duty well, <class>.",
      "englishSHA256": "c09c8cac6042f6ed30dbffcfb28575f23b0aa6fa7c8aa06429e87a31c32b4252"
    },
    {
      "id": "371",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "At War With The Scarlet Crusade",
      "englishSHA256": "fbbd220b7b96d3d137b1510afcd7c5b31c44a1baa53fce9373abac935864c16b"
    },
    {
      "id": "371",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Executor Zygand in Brill has commissioned you to slay Captain Vachon and 5 Scarlet Friars.",
      "englishSHA256": "3b0993d9995ea478f0d31fec5452f9d0fcb6c36c30e68d74ee960b0e43a1d475"
    },
    {
      "id": "371",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "We are still at war and the Scarlet Crusade grows in strength.  The report Executor Arren sent me indicates Scarlet Crusaders have been raiding from the ruined tower in southeastern Tirisfal near the Balnir Farmstead under the command of Captain Vachon.\n\nKill Vachon along with 5 Scarlet Friars. It should prove to be a devastating blow to the Crusade!",
      "englishSHA256": "e90cb35b62c6ff1965dfd047a5fa82c5f3b7d27c6563be2cdfcadea602dfeb59"
    },
    {
      "id": "371",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "I see you have returned but your task is not complete. Perhaps you are at ease with the mere humans interfering with The Dark Lady's plan? Or perhaps you can heed the call of duty and slay Captain Vachon and his band of Scarlet Friars!",
      "englishSHA256": "5d1ddca398be55d8ad207c84d76e02d72d3db3db3f44162527070eb8e6f363f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "371",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Captain Vachon's death will slow down the Scarlet Crusade's advancement in Tirisfal quite a bit. But other threats loom.",
      "englishSHA256": "d316ca647e8c870c96e1c7704ccddb0969626829b6db6388c39c51af1f710af7"
    },
    {
      "id": "372",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "At War With The Scarlet Crusade",
      "englishSHA256": "fbbd220b7b96d3d137b1510afcd7c5b31c44a1baa53fce9373abac935864c16b"
    },
    {
      "id": "372",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Executor Zygand in the town of Brill wants you to assassinate Captain Melrache and his two bodyguards.",
      "englishSHA256": "e36c2b9d3f0cda006b439dbde9894458f5aa03a32078532302ee18d26ee86a5c"
    }
  ],
